

Cosmo-Box

"Create your own cosmos."
A physical sandbox designed to simulate "Aphantasia" (the inability to visualize mental imagery). It turns the inner darkness of the mind into a 25cm physical cosmic space.

🌌 The Experience

• The Void & Starry Space
A borderless darkness woven with black felt, activated by UV light to reveal a constellation of latent memories.
• The Droplet of Intention
A single, vivid neon-red droplet materialized out of nothingness, triggered instantly by a tactile momentary switch.
• Wave & Sonic Control (Phase 2)
An upcoming acoustic infrastructure using an exciter to manipulate the physical trajectory of the droplet via 24Hz / 100Hz frequencies.

🛠️ Open Source Infrastructure

• Frame: 25cm Aluminum Cube Frame
• Actuator: 12V Peristaltic Pump
• Controller: Tactile Momentary Push Switch
• Optics: 30W UV / Black Light
• Medium: Water-based Transparent Fluorescent Paint (Red) + Purified Water

🚀 How to Run

1. Eliminate all ambient room light to achieve complete darkness.
2. Turn on the UV illumination to initialize the cosmic space.
3. Tap the momentary switch to deploy a single droplet of light.
